    <div>

      <p begin="00:00.561" end="00:08.561" ttm:agent="v1">[Intro: Doja Cat]</p>

      <p begin="00:08.779" end="00:10.325" ttm:agent="v1">Ahem, yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:10.325" end="00:11.825" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:11.753" end="00:13.379" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah</p>

      <p begin="00:13.379" end="00:14.939" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, yeah, sheesh</p>

      <p begin="00:14.939" end="00:16.439" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="00:15.163" end="00:16.663" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 21 Savage, Doja Cat]</p>

      <p begin="00:15.618" end="00:19.326" ttm:agent="v1">That ain't something I would do (That ain't something, that ain't something, that ain't something I would do)</p>

      <p begin="00:19.326" end="00:21.498" ttm:agent="v1">Hell nah, let you slide like it's cool (That ain't)</p>

      <p begin="00:21.498" end="00:24.366" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga, hell, naw, fake the truth (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:24.366" end="00:26.178" ttm:agent="v1">Play by rules (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:26.178" end="00:27.870" ttm:agent="v1">Play with you (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:27.870" end="00:29.455" ttm:agent="v1">That ain't something I would do</p>

      <p begin="00:29.455" end="00:30.955" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="00:29.669" end="00:31.169" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: 21 Savage]</p>

      <p begin="00:30.633" end="00:32.133" ttm:agent="v1">I'm havin' plaques on plaques (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="00:32.048" end="00:33.842" ttm:agent="v1">You niggas streams, ain't that (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="00:33.842" end="00:35.633" ttm:agent="v1">I done seen a hater get whacked (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="00:35.633" end="00:37.487" ttm:agent="v1">Hit him nine times, he a cat (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="00:37.487" end="00:39.260" ttm:agent="v1">Grow up on the East, no cap (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="00:39.260" end="00:41.066" ttm:agent="v1">Green Card, green tips in the strap (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="00:41.066" end="00:42.840" ttm:agent="v1">Keep talkin' 'bout why I was born (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="00:42.840" end="00:44.571" ttm:agent="v1">Like a nigga wanna still get clapped (Okay)，</p>

      <p begin="00:44.571" end="00:46.423" ttm:agent="v1">She sit on the wood, no splinter (Facts)</p>

      <p begin="00:46.423" end="00:48.219" ttm:agent="v1">New money like I got a printer (Facts)</p>

      <p begin="00:48.219" end="00:49.922" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't buyin' these b*****s, I rent 'em (Facts)</p>

      <p begin="00:49.922" end="00:51.726" ttm:agent="v1">These porcelain teeth, they not dentures (Facts)</p>

      <p begin="00:51.726" end="00:53.599" ttm:agent="v1">Big VVS stones and they twinkle (21)</p>

      <p begin="00:53.599" end="00:55.379" ttm:agent="v1">I' m at Waffle House rollin' up sprinkles (21)</p>

      <p begin="00:55.379" end="00:57.131" ttm:agent="v1">Let her ex call her phone till he wrinkle (21)</p>

      <p begin="00:57.131" end="00:58.631" ttm:agent="v1">I 'll pop at his ass, he a pimple (21)</p>

      <p begin="00:57.843" end="00:59.343" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="00:58.051" end="00:59.551" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 21 Savage, Doja Cat]</p>

      <p begin="00:58.838" end="01:02.114" ttm:agent="v1">That ain't something I would do (That ain't something, that ain't something, that ain't something I would do)</p>

      <p begin="01:02.114" end="01:05.393" ttm:agent="v1">Hell nah, let you slide like it's cool (That ain't)</p>

      <p begin="01:05.393" end="01:07.834" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga, hell, naw, fake the truth (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:07.834" end="01:09.505" ttm:agent="v1">Play by rules (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:09.505" end="01:11.548" ttm:agent="v1">Play with you (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:11.548" end="01:13.404" ttm:agent="v1">That ain't something I would do</p>

      <p begin="01:13.404" end="01:14.904" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="01:13.615" end="01:15.115" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2: Doja Cat]</p>

      <p begin="01:13.801" end="01:15.301" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I would never lie (Ad-lib)</p>

      <p begin="01:14.816" end="01:16.547" ttm:agent="v1">I would never try (Ad-lib)</p>

      <p begin="01:16.547" end="01:18.389" ttm:agent="v1">I would never holla at you</p>

      <p begin="01:18.389" end="01:19.889" ttm:agent="v1">I would never cry</p>

      <p begin="01:19.862" end="01:23.772" ttm:agent="v1">I would never start no petty beef, that do not fly (Ad-lib)</p>

      <p begin="01:23.772" end="01:27.277" ttm:agent="v1">I would never put myself beneath one of my idols</p>

      <p begin="01:27.277" end="01:28.954" ttm:agent="v1">I wouldn't submit (Money)</p>

      <p begin="01:28.954" end="01:31.122" ttm:agent="v1">I would make you submissive</p>

      <p begin="01:31.122" end="01:32.798" ttm:agent="v1">I can **** nobody man</p>

      <p begin="01:32.798" end="01:34.441" ttm:agent="v1">But ol' girl need the assistance</p>

      <p begin="01:34.441" end="01:36.221" ttm:agent="v1">I don't bee line to no D like</p>

      <p begin="01:36.221" end="01:38.197" ttm:agent="v1">I don't be like none these b*****s</p>

      <p begin="01:38.197" end="01:41.460" ttm:agent="v1">If I feel like havin' free time, hit the seaside with them fishes</p>

      <p begin="01:41.460" end="01:42.960" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah</p>

      <p begin="01:42.208" end="01:43.708" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="01:42.420" end="01:43.920" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 21 Savage, Doja Cat]</p>

      <p begin="01:42.878" end="01:44.567" ttm:agent="v1">That ain't something I would do (That ain't something, that ain't something, that ain't something I would do)</p>

      <p begin="01:44.567" end="01:48.946" ttm:agent="v1">Hell nah, let you slide like it's cool (That ain't)</p>

      <p begin="01:48.946" end="01:51.404" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga, hell, naw, fake the truth (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:51.404" end="01:53.125" ttm:agent="v1">Play by rules (Yeah, yeah, play by rules)</p>

      <p begin="01:53.125" end="01:54.742" ttm:agent="v1">Play with you (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:54.742" end="01:56.242" ttm:agent="v1">That ain't something I would do (Okay)</p>

      <p begin="01:55.845" end="01:57.345" ttm:agent="v1"/>

      <p begin="01:56.073" end="01:57.573" ttm:agent="v1">[Outro: Doja Cat]</p>

      <p begin="01:57.116" end="02:01.116" ttm:agent="v1">Something I would do</p>

